<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Form 07</title><style>@page{size:A4;margin:10mm 12mm 16mm;@bottom-center{content:"Bloomwell Home Care Uganda Limited · Nest Mama Program · Page " counter(page) " of " counter(pages);font:7pt Arial,sans-serif;color:#47615E}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#0B2E2A;font-size:8.5pt;line-height:1.35}
.hd{background:#08675F;color:#fff;padding:3mm 5mm;border-bottom:1.4mm solid #F8991E}.hd table{width:100%}.hd td{vertical-align:middle}.hd .n{font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold}.hd .s{font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}.hd .r{text-align:right;font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}
.tt{border:.3mm solid #08675F;background:#DDF0EC;padding:2.5mm 3mm;margin:3mm 0}.tt b{font-size:12pt;color:#08675F}.tt div{font-size:7.5pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:1mm}
h3{font-size:9pt;color:#08675F;margin:4mm 0 1.5mm;border-bottom:.3mm solid #F8991E;padding-bottom:.8mm;break-after:avoid}
table.r{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2mm 0;margin:0 -2mm}table.r{table-layout:fixed}
.c{vertical-align:bottom;padding-top:1.5mm}.l{display:block;font-size:6.8pt;color:#47615E}.v{display:block;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:5.5mm;font-size:8.5pt;font-weight:bold}
.w{margin-top:1.5mm;break-inside:avoid}.w .v{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:11mm;padding:1mm 1.5mm;font-weight:normal;background:#FBFDFC}
.cb{margin-top:1.8mm;break-inside:avoid}.cb .o{display:inline-block;margin:0 4mm 0 0;font-size:8.5pt}.cb .l{display:inline;margin-right:3mm;font-size:8pt;color:#0B2E2A;font-weight:bold}
.n{border:.3mm solid #E0B25A;background:#FFF6E3;padding:2mm 3mm;margin-top:2.5mm;font-size:7.8pt;break-inside:avoid}
p.t{margin:2mm 0;font-size:8.3pt;break-inside:avoid}
table.g{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:2mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.g th{background:#08675F;color:#fff;font-size:6.8pt;padding:1.4mm;text-align:left}.g td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;height:7.5mm;padding:.5mm 1.5mm;font-size:8pt}.g tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#F2F8F6}
table.s{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:3mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.s th{background:#E8F2F0;font-size:6.8pt;text-align:left;padding:1.2mm;border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5}.s td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;padding:1.2mm;vertical-align:top;height:15mm;font-size:7.8pt}
.s .m{font-size:6.8pt;line-height:1.5}.si{max-height:10mm;display:block}.ev{font-size:6pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:.8mm}
.idr{margin-top:1mm}thead{display:table-header-group}tr{break-inside:avoid}</style></head><body><div class="hd"><table><tr><td style="width:14mm">{{ org.mark_svg|safe }}</td><td><div class="n">BLOOMWELL HOME CARE UGANDA LIMITED</div><div class="s">Patient consent and care forms · Nest Mama Program · You rest, we care</div></td><td class="r">{{ org.city }}, Uganda<br>{{ org.phone }}</td></tr></table></div><div class="tt"><b>FORM 07. NURSING VISIT AND OBSERVATION RECORD</b><div>Record each visit, the observations made, care provided and any action taken. Completed by the attending nurse at every visit.</div></div><table class="r idr"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient full name</span><span class="v">{{ patient.name }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">DOB / age</span><span class="v">{{ patient.dob }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient record ID</span><span class="v">{{ patient.record_id }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Date / time</span><span class="v">{{ form.datetime }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Visit date</span><span class="v">{{ v.visit_date or prefill.visit_date }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Arrival time</span><span class="v">{{ v.arrival_time or prefill.arrival_time }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Departure</span><span class="v">{{ v.departure or prefill.departure }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Location</span><span class="v">{{ v.location or prefill.location }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Nurse name / UNMC number</span><span class="v">{{ v.nurse_name_unmc_number or prefill.nurse_name_unmc_number }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Care plan version</span><span class="v">{{ v.care_plan_version or prefill.care_plan_version }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Allergies checked</span><span class="v">{{ v.allergies_checked or prefill.allergies_checked }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="cb"><span class="l">Two patient identifiers checked:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.two_patient_identifiers_checked == "Yes" else "☐" }} Yes</span></div><div class="cb"><span class="l">Current consent confirmed:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.current_consent_confirmed == "Yes" else "☐" }} Yes</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Patient concerns and change since last visit</span><span class="v">{{ v.patient_concerns_and_change_since_last_v or prefill.patient_concerns_and_change_since_last_v }}</span></div><table class="g"><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Observations with units and relevant symptoms</th><th>Action and response</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>{{ v.t_r1c0 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r1c1 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r1c2 }}</td></tr><tr><td>{{ v.t_r2c0 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r2c1 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r2c2 }}</td></tr><tr><td>{{ v.t_r3c0 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r3c1 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r3c2 }}</td></tr><tr><td>{{ v.t_r4c0 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r4c1 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r4c2 }}</td></tr><tr><td>{{ v.t_r5c0 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r5c1 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r5c2 }}</td></tr><tr><td>{{ v.t_r6c0 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r6c1 }}</td><td>{{ v.t_r6c2 }}</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="n">Record relevant temperature, pulse, respirations, BP, oxygen saturation and oxygen support, pain / tool, glucose or other observations only as indicated. Document abnormal findings and escalation; do not leave an abnormal result without an action entry.</div><h3>Care provided and response</h3><div class="w"><span class="l">Interventions, patient response and deviations from the care plan</span><span class="v">{{ v.interventions_patient_response_and_devia or prefill.interventions_patient_response_and_devia }}</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Medicines recorded on Form 08 / reference</span><span class="v">{{ v.medicines_recorded_on_form_08_reference or prefill.medicines_recorded_on_form_08_reference }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Wound / procedure record reference</span><span class="v">{{ v.wound_procedure_record_reference or prefill.wound_procedure_record_reference }}</span></td></tr></table><h3>Education and ongoing needs</h3><div class="w"><span class="l">Advice given, understanding checked and caregiver tasks</span><span class="v">{{ v.advice_given_understanding_checked_and_c or prefill.advice_given_understanding_checked_and_c }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Concern reported to whom / when; advice received and follow-up responsibility</span><span class="v">{{ v.concern_reported_to_whom_when_advice_rec or prefill.concern_reported_to_whom_when_advice_rec }}</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Next visit / review</span><span class="v">{{ v.next_visit_review or prefill.next_visit_review }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Handover to</span><span class="v">{{ v.handover_to or prefill.handover_to }}</span></td></tr></table><h3>Signatures</h3><table class="s"><tr><th style="width:27mm">Role</th><th style="width:44mm">Name and details</th><th style="width:30mm">Method</th><th>Signature or thumbprint, with e-signature evidence</th><th style="width:24mm">Date / time</th></tr><tr><td><b>Clinician</b></td><td>{{ sig.nurse.name or author.name }}<div class="m">Name and UNMC number</div><div>{{ sig.nurse.detail or author.registration_line }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "password" else "☐" }} Account password<br></td><td>{% if sig.nurse.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.nurse.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.nurse.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.nurse.at }}</td></tr><tr><td><b>Patient or authorised representative</b><div class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.client.esign else "☐" }} I agree to sign electronically</div></td><td>{{ sig.client.name or patient.name }}<div class="m">Name, capacity / role</div><div>{{ sig.client.detail }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "password" else "☐" }} Passphrase<br>{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "thumbprint" else "☐" }} Thumbprint<br></td><td>{% if sig.client.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.client.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.client.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.client.at }}</td></tr></table><div class="n">Attendance acknowledgment confirms the visit only. It is not a waiver of complaints, proof that every intervention was consented to, or acceptance of additional fees.</div></body></html>